  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private Sector Renewable Energy and Energy Efficiency Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s development objective is to help increase privately owned and operated energy production from indigenous renewable sources within the market-based framework of the Turkish Electricity Market Law, enhance demand-side energy efficiency, and thereby help reduce greenhouse gas emissions.</narrative>
  </description>
